VENT TIME",desc:"Validates events and maintains keyed state for joins and aggregations. Event-time windows use watermarks to track progress; explicit lateness rules determine how late events are handled.",x:540,y:280,width:120,height:140,color:"slate",glyph:(0,t.jsxs)(i,{children:[(0,t.jsx)("rect",{x:"-18",y:"-18",width:"36",height:"36"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{d:"M-28-8H-18M-28 8H-18M18 0H28M-8-28V-18M8-28V-18M-8 18V28M8 18V28"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{d:"M-10 5L-4-5L3 5L10-5"})]})},{id:"serving",type:"custom",title:"Serving Store",tech:"KEYED RESULTS",desc:"Holds query-ready results. Idempotent writes or checkpoint-coordinated transactions handle retries. End-to-end delivery guarantees depend on the source, processor and sink.",x:720,y:280,width:120,height:140,color:"yellow",glyph:(0,t.jsxs)(i,{children:[(0,t.jsx)("rect",{x:"-23",y:"-21",width:"46",height:"42"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{d:"M-23-7H23M-23 7H23M-8-21V21",opacity:".6"}),(0,t.jsx)("path",{d:"M0 0H14M0 14H10M0-14H17"})]})},{id:"consumers",type:"serve",title:"Apps & Analytics",tech:"API / BI",desc:"Applications and reporting query the serving store. Freshness depends on processing, sink commits and the consumer’s query or refresh cadence.",x:1e3,y:280,width:140,height:140,color:"zinc"},{id:"contracts",type:"control",title:"Schema Contracts",tech:"VERSIONED EVENTS",desc:"Define event structure, meaning and compatibility across versions. Producers and processors apply these contracts when serializing or validating events.",x:400,y:70,width:160,height:60,color:"neutral"},{id:"checkpoints",type:"control",title:"Checkpoint Store",tech:"STATE + POSITIONS",desc:"Persists consistent snapshots of operator state and source positions. Recovery restores a completed checkpoint, then replays the retained log. Working state belongs to the processor.",x:640,y:70,width:160,height:60,color:"stone"}],links:[{id:"producers-log",from:"producers",to:"log",d:"M190 350H360"},{id:"log-processor",from:"log",to:"processor",d:"M480 350H540"},{id:"p